Generate draft claim formalizations for Knowledge Foundry's aml-cft-pilot-13.
Read AGENTS.md, .agents/AGENTS.md, doc/reasoning-engine.md,
schemas/reasoning-mapping-schema-v1.0.0.json,
src/knowledge_foundry/reasoning/adapter.py, scripts/validate_artifact_examples.py,
and the small examples/reasoning-aml-cft demonstration first.

Scope and authorization
- This is an artifact-generation task, not product implementation or acceptance.
  Perform the work end to end, saving progress and a precise resume checkpoint.
  This instruction authorizes new, reversible artifact files and preparation
  helpers under OUTPUT only. Preserve frozen inputs and existing findings.
- Do not modify source code, schemas, prompts, configuration, original documents,
  existing claim reviews, or their acceptance decisions. Do not commit or publish.
  Do not launch additional agents, models, paid API calls or pipeline regeneration.
  The current Codex session performs the formalization itself.

